				{
					id: "6476372299796ED0"
					item: {
						Count: 1
						ForgeCaps: {
							"celestisynth:celestisynthitemstackcapabilities": {
								cs.aquaSkin: 0
							}
						}
						id: "minecraft:written_book"
						tag: {
							author: "Mr6trt"
							pages: [
								"{\"text\":\"Since the stars still whispered to mankind, long before the world took shape, there existed a realm with no ground, no sky, no end. The Void. A place so pure in absence that even light dared not cross it. And in that perfect darkness… something fell.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"A man. A wanderer. A seeker of truth. He had known the red lands of fire, the dark woods with ash for leaves, and the ruins where forgotten magic lingered in stone. But the world no longer pleased him. He wanted something else. Something untouchable. Something beyond.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"His path led him to the earth’s deepest breath, where stone remembers names long erased. There, twelve blind eyes stared silently in a circle, unmoving, eternal. He understood. He stepped through...\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"What lay beyond was not a world. It was an echo of one. A stillborn universe where time forgot to breathe. The End was only the threshold. Beyond it… the Void.He drifted for what felt like lifetimes — weightless, voiceless — until the silence shattered.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"A violet fire streaked across the nothingness. A meteor. It fell near him, slow and burning, as if the stars themselves rejected it.\\n\\nAt its core was a crystal, not lifeless but pulsing, warm like memory. He touched it.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"And the blade he carried — ordinary, forgotten — melted away.\\n\\nIn its place rose a weapon unlike any other.\\n\\nA blade that drinks, not cuts. That remembers hunger. That feeds.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"And when the bearer falters — when life slips from their grip — the blade awakens. Ten heartbeats of unimaginable strength follow. Ten heartbeats… and then silence.\\n\\nNo forge can create such a thing. It was never made. Only found.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"No forge can create such a thing. It was never made. Only found.\\n\\nThey say it floats still, somewhere beneath all things. Waiting. Listening. Watching.\\n\\nBut only those who vanish from the world may glimpse it.\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Those who silence the thousand-eyed shadows.\\nThose who dare defy the obsidian-winged sentinel.\\nThoses who control Dark Magic, thoses who exchange their humanity to walk with the shadows. The Strike of reaper call for it and runes will\"}"
								"{\"text\":\"consume half of 10000 lifes. And at the end wyou will find the palace of the void. \"}"
								"{\"text\":\"Annihilation does not belong to men.\\nIt chooses.\\nAnd once held, it never lets go.\"}"
							]
							title: "虚空之心脉动"
						}
					}
					type: "item"
				}
